<section class="wb-hero wb-section"><div class="wb-wrap wb-hero-grid"><div><p class="wb-kicker">WHAT WE BUILD</p><h1>We don't build for an industry.<br><em>We build for the problem.</em></h1><p class="wb-lead">E Deviser finds difficult problems worth solving, understands what makes them difficult, and creates the intelligence, systems, and solutions needed to move them forward.</p><a class="wb-link" href="#way">Explore how we build ↓</a></div><div class="wb-field" aria-label="Fragmented signals converging into one intelligent solution"><div class="wb-fragments"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 700 430" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="wb-stream"><stop stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset=".34" stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity=".62"/><stop offset=".68" stop-color="#5AB9B4"/><stop offset=".88" stop-color="#C0E2FD"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#CDFCF4"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="wb-glow"><stop stop-color="#FFFFFF"/><stop offset=".18" stop-color="#CDFCF4"/><stop offset=".42" stop-color="#5AB9B4" stop-opacity=".72"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0382BD" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><g class="wb-lines"><path d="M 24 20 l 13 -3 l 12 1 l 13 -5 l 14 6 C 155 8, 190 35, 220 16 C 340 -5, 420 191, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 36 l 13 1 l 12 -2 l 13 -2 l 14 2 C 155 24, 190 51, 220 32 C 340 11, 420 193, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 52 l 13 5 l 12 -5 l 13 1 l 14 -2 C 155 40, 190 67, 220 48 C 340 27, 420 195, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 68 l 13 9 l 12 -8 l 13 4 l 14 -6 C 155 56, 190 83, 220 64 C 340 43, 420 197, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 84 l 13 13 l 12 -11 l 13 7 l 14 -10 C 155 72, 190 99, 220 80 C 340 59, 420 199, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 100 l 13 -3 l 12 -14 l 13 10 l 14 6 C 155 88, 190 115, 220 96 C 340 75, 420 201, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 116 l 13 1 l 12 -17 l 13 13 l 14 2 C 155 104, 190 131, 220 112 C 340 91, 420 203, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 132 l 13 5 l 12 1 l 13 -5 l 14 -2 C 155 120, 190 147, 220 128 C 340 107, 420 205, 585 215"/><path d="M 24 148 